{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-07-12 16:15:00', 'title': 'DOVER FUELING SOLUTIONS LAUNCHES NEW INNOVATIVE PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS FOR THE RETAIL FUELING MARKET', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , JULY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOVER FUELING SOLUTIONS ("DFS"), A PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV) AND A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF ADVANCED CUSTOMER-FOCUSED TECHNOLOGIES, SERVICES AND SOLUTIONS IN THE FUEL AND CONVENIENCE RETAIL INDUSTRIES, ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF MULTIPLE FUEL DISPENSER MODELS, A NEW POINT-OF-SALE (POS) SYSTEM AND A NEXT-GENERATION AUTOMATIC TANK GAUGE (ATG) CONSOLE.'}